You are the salt of the earth. But if the salt loses its saltiness, what good is it? It is no longer good for anything, except to be thrown out and trampled under people's feet.
You are the light of the world. A city set on a hill cannot be hidden.
And they do not place a lamp above a vessel, but rather it remains in its place to illuminate for everyone who is in the house.
